{"id":"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md","title":"ZFC Dense Subset Poset","display":"df-zfc-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Dense Subset Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Dense Subset Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-dense]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Dense Subset Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"58-df-dense\">58-df-dense</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"58-df-subset\">58-df-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(D,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Density is relative to the declared order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dense","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dense]]","embed":false},{"target":"5